        "image": {
          "large": "https://s4.anilist.co/file/anilistcdn/character/large/b41197-1aJMe2IA78fT.png"
        },
        "description": "__Height:__ 5'5\"\n\nOne half of Benriya, Nicolas is highly skilled with a sword, imposing and somewhat aloof. He is deaf and communicates primarily through sign language, though he can speak in a limited capacity. Along with [Worick](https://anilist.co/character/41198/Arcangelo-Worick), Nick works as a gangster-for-hire. He is an A/O level Twilight or \"tagged\" (in reference to his dog tags), making him both feared and reviled on the streets. Despite his rough exterior, Nicolas has a soft spot for [Nina](https://anilist.co/character/43900/Nina) and is beginning to accept [Alex's](https://anilist.co/character/41199/Benedetto-Alex) presence at the Benriya residence. He is also rather short.\n\n~!Nicolas often overdoses on Celebrer to max out his physical potential, which is why he is considered a \"faker\". His true rank would be around a B/5 at best!~",
        "gender": "Male",
        "age": "34"
      },
